Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|setup.wizard.enabled|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Setup Wizard|


Scenario: HSQ Lto DB 2
Priority: 4
	Given AntCommand the value 'rebuild-database -Ddatabase.type=db2 -Ddelete.liferay.home=false' at locator 'build-test.xml'
	When AntCommand the value 'copy-optional-jars -Ddatabase.type=db2 -Dtodir=${app.server.lib.global.dir}' at locator 'build-test.xml'
	And Portlet shutdown Server
	And Portlet start Server
		|deleteLiferayHome|false|
	And SetupWizard configure PG
		|administratorEmail|test@liferay.com|
		|administratorFirstName|Test|
		|administratorLastName|Test|
		|databasePassword||
		|databaseType|DB2|
		|databaseUserName||
		|jdbcDriverClassName||
		|jdbcURL||
	And Smoke view Welcome Page
		|userFirstName|Joe|
		|userLastName|Bloggs|
	Then Smoke run Smoke
Scenario: HSQ Lto DB 2 Sample Data Disabled
Priority: 4
	Given AntCommand the value 'rebuild-database -Ddatabase.type=db2 -Ddelete.liferay.home=false' at locator 'build-test.xml'
